        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F93CEN, Modern Century Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Schlage made handleset has stylish square mounts on the outside. The Century Handleset is exemplary of quality. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. The Century Handleset exterior features a solid brass construction for security. Primarily used on the inactive side of double doors, this dummy handleset is just for looks and does not latch or lock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>: Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/century-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60cen\"><b>Century Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Century Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Cylinder Century Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 17-13/16\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-1/2\" to 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 11-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-CEN-hand-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262151\"><b>Schlage Century Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish. The Georgian Knob is not available in Satin Chrome. The Andover Knob is not available in Matte Black.</i>\r\n</p>",
