                "description": "Schlage F93 Century Dummy Handleset - This Schlage made handleset has stylish square mounts on the outside. The Century Handleset is exemplary of quality. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. The Century Handleset features a solid brass construction for security. Primarily used on the inactive side of double doors, this dummy handleset is just for looks and does not latch or lock. ",
